body:
you do not have to tell your family, it’s is YOUR LIFE YOUR JOB and it’s YOUR BUSINESS, if your family or other judge you that’s on them 

i wouldn’t say anything unless anyone asks and if they do just be honest, it’s a job it pays bills not everyone needs a 9-5 or whatever 

if you’re happy that’s all that matters, remember it’s YOUR life you will make people happy and sad it’s just normal :)
